# C sources of libmoar and moar, relative to the repository root.
# Read by build.zig (build/zig/sources.zig) and by Configure.pl to fill build/Makefile.in.
# One path per line under a [section]; lines starting with '#' are comments.
# Third-party objects (memmem, zmij, mimalloc) and generated JIT files are handled by the builds, not listed here.
# Entries may use Makefile template variables; today only src/core/nativecall_@nativecall_backend@.c (dyncall or libffi). build.zig expands it to dyncall.

